# Hospital IT Baseline Readiness Checklist

This checklist defines the minimum digital baseline required
before advanced digital health initiatives are undertaken.

## Infrastructure
- Redundant network connectivity
- Secure Wi-Fi coverage across clinical areas
- Server / cloud readiness
- Backup and disaster recovery mechanisms

## Core Systems
- HIS / HMIS operational and supported
- LIS, PACS, RIS integrated or integration-ready
- User authentication and role-based access

## Security & Compliance
- Access control policies
- Audit logs enabled
- Data privacy controls (DPDP alignment)
- Incident response plan

## People & Process
- IT ownership defined
- Clinical champions identified
- Vendor SLAs documented
- Change management process in place
